msgstr "Datoen for eftersynet."
#: modules/contrib/hivelog/src/Entity/HiveInspection.php:117
msgid "External check (before opening)"
msgstr "Udvendig kontrol (før åbning)"
#: modules/contrib/hivelog/src/Entity/HiveInspection.php:118
msgid "Observe flight activity at the entrance — steady traffic with pollen coming in is a good sign. Look for dead bees, signs of robbing, or wasps. Note the hive's weight by lifting the back slightly (hefting)."
msgstr "Iagttag flyveaktiviteten ved flyvehullet — jævn trafik med pollen, der bæres ind, er et godt tegn. Hold øje med døde bier, tegn på røveri eller hvepse. Notér bistadets vægt ved at løfte let i bagenden (vejning i hånden)."
#: modules/contrib/hivelog/src/Entity/HiveInspection.php:137
msgid "Was the queen spotted during this inspection? You don't need to spot her every visit — evidence of her is enough. Look for eggs (single, upright in cell bottoms — confirms a laying queen within the last 3 days), young larvae, and a good brood pattern (solid, not patchy)."
msgstr "Blev dronningen set under dette eftersyn? Du behøver ikke at se hende ved hvert besøg — tegn på hende er nok. Kig efter æg (enkeltvis, stående i bunden af cellerne — bekræfter en æglæggende dronning inden for de sidste 3 dage), unge larver og et godt yngelmønster (sammenhængende, ikke spredt)."
#: modules/contrib/hivelog/src/Entity/HiveInspection.php:155
msgid "Queen Cells"
msgstr "Dronningceller"
#: modules/contrib/hivelog/src/Entity/HiveInspection.php:156
msgid "Were queen cells present? Look along bottom bars and frame faces. Swarm cells (bottom of frames, multiple) mean imminent swarming — act now. Supersedure cells (middle of frames, 1–3) mean they're replacing the queen. Play cups are normal and empty."
msgstr "Var der dronningceller? Kig langs bundlisterne og tavlefladerne. Sværmceller (i bunden af tavlerne, flere) betyder forestående sværmning — grib ind nu. Omdronningsceller (midt på tavlerne, 1–3) betyder, at de er ved at skifte dronning. Spilkopper er normale og tomme."
#: modules/contrib/hivelog/src/Entity/HiveInspection.php:174
msgid "Eggs Seen"
msgstr "Æg set"
#: modules/contrib/hivelog/src/Entity/HiveInspection.php:175
